// Functional Requirement
1. System should support different types of vehicles parking - BIKES , CARS
2. Different vehicles have different payment
3. Parkinglot should have different Parking floors 
4. Each Floor should have rows and each row should have 10 parking slots
5.System should able to genearte a ParkingTicket for each vehicles
7. System should mark the spot as occupied or unavailable
8.System should check if parking slot is available
9. System should support searching a parked vehicle using the ParkingTicket.
10. System should allow exists of a vehicle using a ParkingTicket only

// NFR
1. it should be modular
2. It should follow SOLID principles
3. There should be low coupling and high cohension
4. Design should support differen types of vehicles and payemnt strategy in future
5. The design should be testable and maintable.

// Entity
1. Vehicles
2. Payment
3. Parking Floor
4. Parking Row
5. Parking Spot
6.ParkingLot
7.ParkingTicket
8. VehicleType (enum)
9.ParkingSPOTStatus (enum)

// RelationShip

1. ParkingLot 1........* (Parking Floor) (composition)
2. Parking Floor 1.........m (Parking row )(composition)
3. Parking Row 1...........10 (Parking Spot)(composition)
4. Payment 1.................1 (ParkingTicket) (aggregation)
5. ParkingTicket 1...........1 (Vehicles) (association)
6. ParkingTicket 1............1 (Parking Spot) (association)


// Attributes & Method

